# Legal: a full-scope law firm in the European Union. Sourced by mg-install. [NFR-SEC-1] [NFR-PRV-1]
PROFILE_TITLE="Legal practice (European Union)"
PROFILE_SUMMARY="Clients, matters, parties, documents, deadlines, time, conflict checks, AML checks and data subject requests, with legal hold, privilege review and AML escalation as human-gated actions. Local AI on the Granite model."
PROFILE_COMPONENTS="forge mimir"
