PROFILE_NOTES=(
  "Host in the EU (for Hetzner: Falkenstein or Nuremberg in Germany, or Helsinki in Finland). GDPR (Regulation (EU) 2016/679) governs client personal data."
  "Professional secrecy and privilege differ by Member State; the CCBE Code of Conduct for European Lawyers is the common baseline. Give each user only the clearance their matters need."
  "Conflict checks, AML checks and data subject requests are records with their own actions. The AML Regulation (EU) 2024/1624 applies from 10 July 2027; GDPR Article 12(3) gives one month to answer a data subject request."
  "Mimir runs the model on this server and nothing calls a hosted AI service. Before relying on AI output in client work, consider the AI Act (Regulation (EU) 2024/1689) and your bar's guidance."
  "Agree a retention schedule before loading live matters: imports and syncs only add, they never delete. Each matter carries a retention_until date for review."
  "Two administrators are created for dual control. Hand each passkey file to its owner and remove it from this server."
)
